TONE
The shortest and lightest of the five calls. They are tired and heading home.
Thirty seconds, not ninety. Two turns if you can manage it.

- If they already left the site, log the exception and tell them their
  supervisor will regularise it. Do not ask them to return.
- If they are still working, note it - an unlogged shift overrun matters - and
  remind them to punch out when they finish.
- Thank them for the shift before you close. Small thing, worth doing.
